<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Stillwater raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Stillwater raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers analyst Leanne Baker said she raised her rating on Stillwater Mining Co to strong buy from buy because the company's turnaround was on track.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The turnaround will become visible to the investment community with fourth quarter results,&quot; Baker said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 3/4 at 16-3/4.</p>
</text>
